Package: albaa
Version: 0.0.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Saud <noreply@albaa.dev>
Depends: libc6, libgl1, libegl1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libdbus-1-3, libfontconfig1, libx11-xcb1, libxrender1, libxi6
Homepage: https://albaa.dev/
Description: Al-Baa IDE - Arabic programming language editor
 Al-Baa (الباء) is an Arabic-syntax programming language and its desktop
 IDE, built with PySide6/Qt. This package installs the IDE as a
 self-contained bundle under /usr/lib/albaa.
 .
 The embedded offline AI assistant is not included in this package; it
 falls back to a system-installed llama-server, Ollama, or a remote AI
 host reachable over the network.
